) VALUES (
    'therese-johaug-profile',
    '{"en": "Therese Johaug: Cross-Country Skiing''s Greatest", "de": "Therese Johaug: Die Größte des Langlaufs", "fr": "Therese Johaug : La plus grande du ski de fond", "it": "Therese Johaug: La più grande dello sci di fondo", "es": "Therese Johaug: La más grande del esquí de fondo", "pt": "Therese Johaug: A maior do esqui cross-country", "nl": "Therese Johaug: De grootste van het langlaufen", "ar": "تيريز يوهاوغ: الأعظم في التزلج الريفي", "ja": "テレセ・ヨハウグ：クロスカントリースキーの最高峰", "zh": "Therese Johaug: Yueye Huaxue de Zuiweida", "ko": "테레세 요하우그: 크로스컨트리 스키의 최고"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "The Norwegian legend has won more world championship gold medals than any other cross-country skier in history. Her dominance defined an era of the sport.", "de": "Die norwegische Legende hat mehr WM-Goldmedaillen gewonnen als jeder andere Langläufer in der Geschichte.", "fr": "La légende norvégienne a remporté plus de médailles d''or aux championnats du monde que tout autre skieur de fond de l''histoire.", "it": "La leggenda norvegese ha vinto più medaglie d''oro ai campionati mondiali di qualsiasi altro sciatore di fondo nella storia.", "es": "La leyenda noruega ha ganado más medallas de oro en campeonatos mundiales que cualquier otro esquiador de fondo en la historia.", "pt": "A lenda norueguesa ganhou mais medalhas de ouro em campeonatos mundiais do que qualquer outro esquiador cross-country na história.", "nl": "De Noorse legende heeft meer WK gouden medailles gewonnen dan elke andere langlaufer in de geschiedenis.", "ar": "فازت الأسطورة النرويجية بميداليات ذهبية في بطولات العالم أكثر من أي متزلج ريفي آخر في التاريخ", "ja": "ノルウェーのレジェンドは、歴史上どのクロスカントリースキーヤーよりも多くの世界選手権金メダルを獲得しています。", "zh": "Nuowei chuanqi yingqu le lishi shang renhe qita yueye huaxue xuanshou dou duo de shijie jinbiaosai jinpai.", "ko": "노르웨이 레전드는 역사상 다른 어떤 크로스컨트리 스키 선수보다 더 많은 세계 선수권 금메달을 획득했습니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p>Therese Johaug stands as the most decorated <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">cross-country skier</a> in world championship history. The Norwegian legend''s dominance over the past decade has been so complete that she changed the competitive landscape of the sport.</p><h2>Record-Breaking Success</h2><p>Johaug holds the record for most world championship gold medals in cross-country skiing. Her ability to win across multiple distances - from sprints to distance races - demonstrates an unparalleled combination of speed and endurance.</p><p>Her major championship medal collection is simply staggering, representing years of consistent excellence at the highest level.</p><h2>Dominant Distance Racer</h2><p>In distance events, Johaug was often in a league of her own. Her ability to break away from the field and build insurmountable leads became her trademark racing style.</p><p>Competitors would often race for silver, knowing that catching Johaug was virtually impossible once she built her gap.</p><h2>Norwegian Tradition</h2><p>Norway has produced many cross-country skiing legends, but Johaug''s medal haul puts her in a category by herself. She has inspired the next generation of Norwegian skiers, including <a href=\"/frida-karlsson-profile/\">Frida Karlsson</a> and other rising stars.</p><h2>Complete Skier</h2><p>Johaug excelled in both classic and skating techniques, making her dangerous in any format. This versatility, combined with her exceptional fitness, made her nearly unbeatable in her prime.</p><h2>Legacy</h2><p>When historians discuss the greatest cross-country skiers ever, Johaug''s name will be at or near the top of every list. Her dominance, sportsmanship, and dedication have left an indelible mark on the sport she loves.</p>", "de": "<p>Therese Johaug steht als meistdekorierte <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">Langläuferin</a> in der Geschichte der Weltmeisterschaften. Die Dominanz der norwegischen Legende im letzten Jahrzehnt war so vollständig, dass sie die Wettbewerbslandschaft des Sports veränderte.</p><h2>Rekordbrechnder Erfolg</h2><p>Johaug hält den Rekord für die meisten WM-Goldmedaillen im Langlauf.</p><h2>Dominante Distanzläuferin</h2><p>In Distanzrennen war Johaug oft in einer eigenen Liga.</p><h2>Norwegische Tradition</h2><p>Sie hat die nächste Generation norwegischer Skiläufer inspiriert, darunter <a href=\"/frida-karlsson-profile/\">Frida Karlsson</a>.</p>", "fr": "<p>Therese Johaug est la <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">skieuse de fond</a> la plus décorée de l''histoire des championnats du monde. La domination de la légende norvégienne au cours de la dernière décennie a changé le paysage compétitif du sport.</p><h2>Succès record</h2><p>Johaug détient le record du plus grand nombre de médailles d''or aux championnats du monde en ski de fond.</p><h2>Coureuse de distance dominante</h2><p>Dans les épreuves de distance, Johaug était souvent dans une classe à part.</p><h2>Tradition norvégienne</h2><p>Elle a inspiré la prochaine génération, notamment <a href=\"/frida-karlsson-profile/\">Frida Karlsson</a>.</p>", "it": "<p>Therese Johaug è la <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">sciatrice di fondo</a> più decorata nella storia dei campionati mondiali. Il dominio della leggenda norvegese nell''ultimo decennio ha cambiato il panorama competitivo dello sport.</p><h2>Successo da record</h2><p>Johaug detiene il record per il maggior numero di medaglie d''oro ai campionati mondiali nello sci di fondo.</p><h2>Dominante nelle gare di distanza</h2><p>Nelle gare di distanza, Johaug era spesso in una classe a parte.</p>", "es": "<p>Therese Johaug es la <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">esquiadora de fondo</a> más condecorada en la historia de los campeonatos mundiales. El dominio de la leyenda noruega en la última década cambió el panorama competitivo del deporte.</p><h2>Éxito récord</h2><p>Johaug tiene el récord de más medallas de oro en campeonatos mundiales en esquí de fondo.</p>", "pt": "<p>Therese Johaug é a <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">esquiadora cross-country</a> mais condecorada da história dos campeonatos mundiais. A dominância da lenda norueguesa na última década mudou o cenário competitivo do esporte.</p><h2>Sucesso recorde</h2><p>Johaug detém o recorde de mais medalhas de ouro em campeonatos mundiais no esqui cross-country.</p>", "nl": "<p>Therese Johaug staat als de meest gedecoreerde <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">langlaufer</a> in de geschiedenis van de wereldkampioenschappen. De dominantie van de Noorse legende in het afgelopen decennium was zo compleet dat ze het competitieve landschap van de sport veranderde.</p><h2>Recordbrekend succes</h2><p>Johaug houdt het record voor de meeste WK gouden medailles in het langlaufen.</p>", "ar": "<p>تقف تيريز يوهاوغ كأكثر <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">متزلجة ريفية</a> تتويجاً في تاريخ بطولات العالم. كانت هيمنة الأسطورة النرويجية على مدى العقد الماضي كاملة لدرجة أنها غيرت المشهد التنافسي للرياضة.</p><h2>نجاح قياسي</h2><p>تحمل يوهاوغ الرقم القياسي لأكثر ميداليات ذهبية في بطولات العالم للتزلج الريفي.</p>", "ja": "<p>テレセ・ヨハウグは、世界選手権史上最も多くの勲章を持つ<a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">クロスカントリースキーヤー</a>です。過去10年間におけるノルウェーのレジェンドの支配は非常に完全で、スポーツの競争環境を変えました。</p><h2>記録破りの成功</h2><p>ヨハウグは、クロスカントリースキーで最も多くの世界選手権金メダルの記録を保持しています。</p>", "zh": "<p>Therese Johaug shi shijie jinbiaosai lishi shang zui shou rongeyu de <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">yueye huaxue</a> yundongyuan. Nuowei chuanqi zai guoqu shinian de zhupei diwei ruci wanzheng, yi zhi ta gaibian le yundong de jingzheng geju.</p><h2>Poulu de chenggong</h2><p>Johaug baochi yueye huaxue zhong zuuduo shijie jinbiaosai jinpai de jilu.</p>", "ko": "<p>테레세 요하우그는 세계 선수권 역사상 가장 많은 훈장을 받은 <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">크로스컨트리 스키</a> 선수입니다. 지난 10년간 노르웨이 레전드의 지배력은 스포츠의 경쟁 구도를 바꿀 정도로 완전했습니다.</p><h2>기록적인 성공</h2><p>요하우그는 크로스컨트리 스키에서 가장 많은 세계 선수권 금메달 기록을 보유하고 있습니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'athlete-profile',
    'XC',
    '{"en": "Therese Johaug profile - Norwegian cross-country skiing legend and most decorated world championship athlete in the sport''s history.", "de": "Therese Johaug Profil - Norwegische Langlauf-Legende und meistdekorierte WM-Athletin.", "fr": "Profil de Therese Johaug - Légende norvégienne du ski de fond et athlète la plus décorée des championnats du monde.", "it": "Profilo di Therese Johaug - Leggenda norvegese dello sci di fondo e atleta più decorata dei campionati mondiali.", "es": "Perfil de Therese Johaug - Leyenda noruega del esquí de fondo y atleta más condecorada de los campeonatos mundiales.", "pt": "Perfil de Therese Johaug - Lenda norueguesa do esqui cross-country e atleta mais condecorada dos campeonatos mundiais.", "nl": "Therese Johaug profiel - Noorse langlauf legende en meest gedecoreerde WK atleet.", "ar": "ملف تيريز يوهاوغ - أسطورة التزلج الريفي النرويجية والرياضية الأكثر تتويجاً في بطولات العالم", "ja": "テレセ・ヨハウグのプロフィール - ノルウェーのクロスカントリースキーレジェンドで世界選手権史上最も多くの勲章を持つ選手", "zh": "Therese Johaug jianjie - Nuowei yueye huaxue chuanqi he shijie jinbiaosai lishi shang zui shou rongeyu de yundongyuan", "ko": "테레세 요하우그 프로필 - 노르웨이 크로스컨트리 스키 레전드이자 세계 선수권 역사상 가장 많은 훈장을 받은 선수"}'::jsonb,
